// Aether — About panel config
//
// Run by the About override install-extras.sh wires into
// ~/.config/omarchy/extensions/omarchy-menu.jsonc, so pressing About in the
// Omarchy menu shows this instead of the shared fetch config.
//
// Same pixel-cloud emblem and key gradient as the fetch config, but no
// user@host title line — the About panel is brand, not identity.
{
  "$schema": "https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch/raw/dev/doc/json_schema.json",
